            <g class="h-mou"><path d="M65 38 Q59 33 53.5 37.5 Q55 43 61.5 40.5 Q64 39.5 65 38 Q66 39.5 68.5 40.5 Q75 43 76.5 37.5 Q71 33 65 38 Z" fill="#2b1d14"/></g>
